// expect-error: help: `Evens` is one concrete type: return a `Filter<Range<i64>>` here too, or call `evens` for it
// expect-error: 27:9: named `some` type `Gen` cannot take type parameters
// expect-error: 31:9: generic function `count` cannot define `Count`
// expect-error: 33:25: `bad` returns `List<i64>`, which is not `Display`
